# The horizon behind every page but HOME: the eclipsed moon in the page's colour, the stars, the row
# selected tinted (screenshots in build/scenarios/horizon/); HOME keeps its own corona
wait 1500
shot home.png
tap FX
expect view 3
wait 300
shot fx.png
tap LFO
expect view 4
wait 300
shot journey.png
tap EDIT
expect view 2
wait 300
shot scene.png
tap ENV
expect view 1
wait 300
shot shape.png
tap GLO
expect view 5
wait 300
shot system.png
expect blits >-1
wait 10000
# ten seconds of a still page: the stars and the breath only (a header beat mark aside), a few transfers a second
expect blits <200
shot system_later.png
tap HOME
expect view 0
